  * Use download.savannah.gnu.org in watch instead of using mirror URL.
  * Marked the package as multi-arch foreign.
  * Bumped standards-version to 3.9.4.
  * Bumped debhelper required for build to >= 9.
  * Bumped compat level to 9.
  * Use canonical anonscm.d.o URL for Vcs-* fields.
  * Dropped override for dh_builddeb to use xz compression, with dpkg 1.17
    xz is used by default to compress data.

